  "question": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\qt0126_1d5e4af090a5.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 176px;\" /><br /><br />Consider a uniform cubical box of side a on a rough floor that is to be moved by applying minimum possible force <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> at a point <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> above its centre of mass (see figure). If the coefficient of friction is <math><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn></math> , the maximum possible value of <math><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> for a box not to topple before moving is ________"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "50",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0126_9ca68ca70b60.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 278px;\" /><br />For no toppling<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math><br /><math><mn>0.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0.75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> (in limiting case)<br />But it is not possible as <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> can maximum be equal to <math><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50.00</mn></math>"
  }
